Fix PowerShell npm execution policy:
1. Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned
2. Get-ExecutionPolicy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Go to OWASP Juice Shop folder:
cd path
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Install required security libraries:
npm install validator bcrypt helmet jsonwebtoken
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Start OWASP Juice Shop:
1. npm install
2. npm start
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test WEAK password (should be rejected):
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/rest/user/login `
-H "Content-Type: application/json" `
-d '{"email":"test@test.com","password":"123"}'
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test SQL Injection (should fail):
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/rest/user/login `
-H "Content-Type: application/json" `
-d '{"email":"admin@juice-sh.op\' OR 1=1--","password":"Admin@123"}'
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test XSS payload (should fail):
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/rest/user/login `
-H "Content-Type: application/json" `
-d '{"email":"<script>alert(1)</script>","password":"Strong@123"}'
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test VALID login:
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/rest/user/login `
-H "Content-Type: application/json" `
-d '{"email":"user@test.com","password":"Strong@123"}'
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Stop server:
Ctrl + C
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
